{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/21/5653584/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46 真夏の全国ツアー2013 FINAL！＠国立代々木競技場第一体育館（2013年10月6日）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな若いねー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田がポニーテールしてた！\nライブでポニーテールとか久しくやってない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当時はポニーテールばっかりしてたなあ\nって思い出したよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/21/5653584/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/21/5653584/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46時間TVスペシャルライブ 4th Anniversary 深川麻衣 selection songs 乃木坂46は好きですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セトリは\n1stから13thまで\n各シングルごとに1曲ずつ\nまいまいがセレクトしてくれたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/21/5653584/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"OVERTURE\n１ぐるぐるカーテン○\n２狼に口笛を\n３涙がまだ悲しみだった頃\n４制服のマネキン\n５君の名は希望○\n６他の星から○\n７そんなバカな...○\n８生まれたままで○\n９夏のFree＆Easy\n10あの日、僕は咄嗟に嘘をついた○\n11ボーダー\n12太陽ノック\n13悲しみの忘れ方○\n乃木坂の詩○"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1曲終わるごとにMCがあって\n音楽番組のような感じですね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バースデーライブらしくほぼオリメンで\n最後の2曲は全員でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田は『狼に口笛を』後のMCに\n出させていただきました＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のぎ声リレー最後の\n『乃木坂の詩』も録れましたね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/21/5653584/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌だけじゃなく\n振り付けもちゃんとできてて\nPanasonic応援力チャージプロジェクトの動画を\nちゃんと見てくれたのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/21/5653584/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりちゃ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/21/5653584/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のぎ天"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自由が丘チームだったわけです( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非、紹介したところに\n行ってみて欲しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/21/5653584/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飯ぺろの中田から言わせれば\n渋谷チームの『Minimal』は\n今、流行りのBean to Barのチョコのお店で\nよく話題になってたから\nかなりテンション上がりました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前から行きたいと思ってたから\n食べれて嬉しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/21/5653584/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/21/5653584/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂コラボLabo 乃木坂46の「の」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『乃木坂46 勝手に選抜！』の第4弾"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は『お姫様選抜』でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"汗かき選抜とか\n入りそうなものにも入らない中田が\nこれに入らないのは当然と思ってたら\nまさかのギリギリで入ってました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"17位とかもはや\nたまたまだと思うんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/21/5653584/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"46時間も\nあともう少し！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}